WEBVTT

1
00:00:20.671 --> 00:00:22.201
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Sorry I’m late.

2
00:00:22.565 --> 00:00:23.676
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> No problem.

3
00:00:33.092 --> 00:00:34.112
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Are you OK?

4
00:00:35.078 --> 00:00:36.808
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yes, I’m fine.

5
00:00:46.533 --> 00:00:48.227
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I’m sorry I left like that.

6
00:00:48.737 --> 00:00:49.848
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> That’s OK.

7
00:00:59.665 --> 00:01:01.140
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> It’s a beautiful evening.

8
00:01:01.322 --> 00:01:03.453
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yes, it is.

9
00:01:12.778 --> 00:01:14.763
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I got an interview.

10
00:01:15.109 --> 00:01:17.495
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Wow, that’s great!